{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01170","headline":"相和歌辞 从军行 · 李颀","name":"相和歌辞 从军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白日登山望烽火，昏黄饮马傍交河。\n行人刁斗风砂暗，公主琵琶幽怨多。\n野营万里无城郭，雨雪纷纷连大漠。\n胡雁哀鸣夜夜飞，胡儿眼泪双双落。\n闻道玉门犹被遮，应将性命逐轻车。\n年年战骨埋荒外，空见蒲萄入汉家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}